<div class="page">
  <h2 class="sr-only" style="position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;">DC-1 VulnHub penetration test writeup</h2>

  <div class="hero">
    <span class="hero-badge">CTF Writeup</span>
    <h1>DC-1 VulnHub — Full Compromise</h1>
    <p>A complete walkthrough of the DC-1 VulnHub machine — from host discovery to root. Covers Drupalgeddon2 exploitation, credential extraction, and SUID privilege escalation.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="meta-row">
    <div class="meta-tag"><span class="dot" style="background:#E24B4A;"></span> Difficulty: Beginner</div>
    <div class="meta-tag"><span class="dot" style="background:#1D9E75;"></span> OS: Linux (Debian)</div>
    <div class="meta-tag"><span class="dot" style="background:#BA7517;"></span> Flags: 4</div>
    <div class="meta-tag"><span class="dot" style="background:#7F77DD;"></span> CVE-2018-7600</div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-label">Attack chain</div>
    <div class="attack-chain">
      <div class="chain-node">Recon</div><div class="chain-arrow">›</div>
      <div class="chain-node">Port scan</div><div class="chain-arrow">›</div>
      <div class="chain-node">Enum</div><div class="chain-arrow">›</div>
      <div class="chain-node highlight">Drupalgeddon2</div><div class="chain-arrow">›</div>
      <div class="chain-node">Shell</div><div class="chain-arrow">›</div>
      <div class="chain-node">Creds</div><div class="chain-arrow">›</div>
